  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Comparing on both sides<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Case <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>:</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;ways</p><p>Case <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;ways</p><p>Total <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;ways</p>",
